# Each not-yet-mounted cell renders up to 50 skeleton bars with `animate-pulse` (an infinite CSS
# animation): ~16 per cell, ~8,000 running animations at 500 cells. Every CodeMirror style sheet
# rewrite invalidates all running keyframe animations, so each editor mount recalculates style for
# every remaining bar: O(cells^2).
# VALIDATED (CSS injection `.mo-code-placeholder-bar{animation:none!important}` and experiment
# "pulse"): 250-cell load main-thread time 87.5 s -> 35.7 s; 500 cells 386 s -> 164 s.
# If the shimmer matters, animate one wrapper per cell (opacity on .mo-code-placeholder) instead.

